// ============ 49. Demo Recording State 2026-05-01 ============
NotionPublishService.EnterpriseEntry e49 = new NotionPublishService.EnterpriseEntry();
e49.title = '49. Demo Recording State 2026-05-01 â€” Pre-Recording Snapshot + Outstanding Items';
e49.situation = new NotionPublishService.SituationSection();
e49.situation.context = 'On 2026-05-01, the TechnoStore demo was scheduled for first formal recording attempt. All 5 production systems were live (Salesforce + Stripe + Slack + Sendcloud + DocuSign), the 4 DACH demo accounts were provisioned with Quote data, and the 3-recording variant plan (Physical primary + Digital secondary + Mixed tertiary) was ready. Before pressing record, a final state-snapshot was needed to catalog any outstanding bugs or quirks so the recording could either work around them or pause to fix.';
e49.situation.problem = 'Demo recordings expose every weakness in real time â€” a single 30-second pause to debug something destroys 12 minutes of credibility. Pre-recording state audit identified 4 outstanding items: (1) Salesforce email daily limit hit during testing causing some bulk-test sends to silently drop, (2) Slack last 2-3 webhook deliveries did not arrive in #payments-team (uncertain cause â€” possibly Slack rate limit transient), (3) hotspot DNS instability during home WiFi outages affecting external system reachability, (4) Sendcloud v3 end-to-end Mule path not yet verified with the integration_id added after the v3 migration.';
e49.task = new NotionPublishService.TaskSection();
e49.task.goal = 'Document the pre-recording state thoroughly: what is verified working, what is uncertain, what mitigations are in place. Make decisions about which outstanding items must be resolved before recording (blockers) vs which can be worked around in the recording script (acceptable known-issues). Produce a go/no-go decision for the 2026-05-01 recording slot.';
e49.task.constraints = 'Recording session has a fixed 4-hour window scheduled with the studio (or 4-hour focused time block if recording at home). Cannot extend if blockers persist. Each outstanding item must be either (a) fixed before recording, (b) worked around via script modification, or (c) demoted to acceptable-known-issue that does not affect recording quality. Honest documentation matters more than perfection â€” recruiters appreciate real engineering tradeoffs over polished facades.';
e49.task.successCriteria = 'Pre-recording snapshot documented in memory with each outstanding item categorized (blocker / workaround / accept). Go/no-go decision made: go = all blockers resolved + workarounds tested + accepts documented as future work; no-go = at least one blocker remains. If go, proceed to record; if no-go, defer recording to 2026-05-04 (next available slot) and resolve blockers in interim.';
e49.action = new NotionPublishService.ActionSection();
e49.action.approach = 'Reviewed each outstanding item: email daily limit (verified Salesforce reset at midnight UTC + recording starts at 14:00 UTC, well past reset), Slack delivery failures (retested via Postman with same payload â€” all delivered successfully, conclusion: transient Slack issue not reproducible), hotspot DNS (acceptable workaround: use ethernet at recording location, hotspot only for emergency), Sendcloud Mule end-to-end (tested with TEST-002 reference â†’ verified DHL pickup scheduled, integration_id 577997 working end-to-end). All 4 items resolved or accepted. Go decision made for 2026-05-01 recording.';
e49.action.implementation = new List<String>{
    'Issue 1 â€” Salesforce email daily limit: verified limit reset window (midnight UTC daily) â†’ recording start 14:00 UTC means 14 hours of full quota available, more than sufficient for 3 recording variants Ã— 5 emails each = 15 emails total',
    'Mitigation 1: don\'t run any bulk email tests on recording day morning to preserve quota; verified quota panel shows 4847/5000 remaining at 13:00 UTC',
    'Issue 2 â€” Slack last 2-3 webhook deliveries missing: retested via Postman with exact same payload to slack.payments.webhook.url â†’ all 5 test sends delivered successfully within 2 seconds; concluded transient Slack issue (possibly rate limit during prior bulk test) not reproducible',
    'Mitigation 2: monitor Slack delivery in real time during recording (Slack window open in 4-quadrant OBS layout); if a delivery fails, can retake the specific segment without re-recording the full demo',
