    'Issue 4 â€” Sendcloud v3 Mule end-to-end with integration_id added: tested by activating Order on test account â†’ Mule flow fired â†’ Sendcloud TEST-002 created in dashboard with correct customer info from SF Account/Contact + integration_id 577997 + DHL pickup scheduled within 60 seconds',
    'Mitigation 4: end-to-end verified working; no recording risk',
