};
NotionPublishService.CodeSnippet e49c1 = new NotionPublishService.CodeSnippet();
e49c1.caption = 'Pre-recording checklist (markdown)';
e49c1.language = 'markdown';
e49c1.code = '# Pre-Recording Checklist â€” 2026-05-01 14:00 UTC\n\n## System Health Checks (30 min before recording)\n\n- [ ] Salesforce: sf org display â†’ token valid, instance reachable\n- [ ] Mule: Anypoint Studio runtime running locally (port 8081)\n- [ ] Stripe: stripe ping â†’ Stripe API reachable, test mode confirmed\n- [ ] Sendcloud: GET /api/v3/orders â†’ returns 200, sandbox tenant active\n- [ ] Slack: test webhook POST to #payments-team and #warehouse â†’ both deliver\n- [ ] DocuSign: GET /v2.1/accounts/{id}/envelopes â†’ returns 200, demo account active\n- [ ] JIRA: GET /rest/api/3/myself â†’ returns 200, user admin@technostore.example active\n- [ ] Notion: parent page reachable + integration token valid\n\n## Recording Environment\n\n- [ ] OBS Studio: 4-quadrant scene loaded (SF top-left, Slack top-right, DocuSign bottom-left, Sendcloud bottom-right)\n- [ ] Microphone: levels checked, no background noise\n- [ ] Webcam: optional (currently disabled for first recording)\n- [ ] Screen recording resolution: 1920x1080 @ 30 fps\n- [ ] Storage: 50+ GB free on recording drive\n- [ ] Notifications: disabled (no Slack DMs popping up mid-demo)\n\n## Demo Data State\n\n- [ ] Run scripts/demo_reset.apex â†’ cleans existing Orders/Contracts/Quotes for 4 DACH accounts\n- [ ] Run scripts/setup_demo_opps_quotes.apex â†’ recreates 4 Quotes in Draft state\n- [ ] Verify Salesforce Browse Catalog opens with Hamburg DataWorks context â†’ shows 4 workstation tiers\n- [ ] Verify Quote line items show 19% VAT formula calculation\n\n## Outstanding Items Status\n\n| Item | Status | Mitigation |\n|------|--------|-----------|\n| SF email daily limit | Acceptable | 4847/5000 remaining at 13:00 UTC; need only 15 sends |\n| Slack delivery (last 2-3 failed) | Resolved | Retested via Postman, all delivered. Transient issue. |\n| Hotspot DNS instability | Worked around | Ethernet connection at recording location, hotspot backup only |\n| Sendcloud v3 + integration_id 577997 | Resolved | Tested end-to-end with TEST-002, DHL pickup scheduled |\n\n## Go/No-Go: **GO**';
e49.action.codeSnippets = new List<NotionPublishService.CodeSnippet>{ e49c1 };
e49.result = new NotionPublishService.ResultSection();
e49.result.outcome = '2026-05-01 14:00 UTC recording proceeded as planned. All 3 recording variants (Physical / Digital / Mixed) captured successfully. 4 outstanding items resolved or worked around per the pre-recording snapshot. Primary 12-minute Physical Order recording captured the full end-to-end narrative without retake interruptions. Demo recording stored as portfolio asset, ready for recruiter distribution.';
e49.result.tradeoffsAndLessons = 'Pre-recording state audits are the single most valuable risk-mitigation practice for portfolio demos. The 30-minute checklist is small compared to a 4-hour wasted recording session. Honest documentation of "what is working, what is uncertain, what is acceptable" beats pretending everything is perfect â€” recruiters respect engineers who can articulate real engineering tradeoffs. The resume-strategy pattern (demo_reset.apex returns to known state in <30 seconds) is invaluable mid-recording when something does go wrong â€” clean retry vs. ruined session.';
