e50.result.outcome = 'Complete Q2C lifecycle documented as single coherent narrative spanning 11 stages with state transitions + system fan-out timing + drill-down references to specific STAR entries. This entry serves as the table-of-contents + narrative spine for the entire 50-entry Notion portfolio. Recruiter reading this entry alone understands the full architecture; recruiter wanting depth clicks through to specific entries. Demo state captured (DOC-000000009 latest invoice) for posterity. Project end-state: production-grade Q2C demonstration ready for recruiter outreach.';
e50.result.tradeoffsAndLessons = 'The portfolio narrative is more valuable than the feature inventory. A coherent Q2C story that flows from Quote to Cash beats a list of 50 individual features. The drill-down structure (this entry links to specific entries; specific entries reference back to this one via "see entry 50 for end-to-end context") is the canonical pattern for technical documentation at scale â€” index page + detail pages, mutually-cross-referenced. This entry intentionally LAST because it depends on all other 49 entries â€” the final synthesis after all the parts are built.';
